   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## hy3d-full-workflow.json\n\nHy3D shape -> texture\n\n**Does:** image -> 3D mesh -> texture -> bake, with Hunyuan3D 2.x.\n**View:** both exports end in a `Preview3D` node — the untextured checkpoint and the textured result can be orbited in the canvas (the viewer reads from `output/`).\n**Note:** the shape and the texture are exported separately (untextured and textured GLB) so\nthe shape can be rigged/retopo'd before texturing.\n**See:** `3d/README.md`, `3d/pipeline-design.md`, and the widget reference in `3d/hy3d-knobs.md`.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S11** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E2a-e** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "color": "#332922",
   "bgcolor": "#593930"
  },
